                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm a huge endless fan, but this game has some really bad flaws.  \n\n-You get damaged by enemies touching you.  This would be okay, if it didn't include enemies that are ignoring you and going to an objective.  \n-The projectile attacks from archer and mage have to line up just right, if you are a bit too high or low, it will completely miss. \n-Some floors are win or lose based on the first door.\n-I have a 360 controller, but i could not get it to work with this game, regardless of restarting it or toggling the settings.  It works fine in other steam games.\n-Its too much money in this state, it has some neat mechanics, but it is closer to a 10$ game.",
